{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19","id":291306262,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyOTEzMDYyNjI=","number":19,"title":"A 3-nodes cluster of YugaByte doesn't tolerate an isolation of a single node","user":{"login":"rystsov","id":2119542,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTk1NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2119542?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov","html_url":"https://github.com/rystsov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rystsov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":711841622,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MTE4NDE2MjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"This issue is a bug"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"amitanandaiyer","id":32495790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDk1Nzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32495790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer","html_url":"https://github.com/amitanandaiyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"amitanandaiyer","id":32495790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDk1Nzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32495790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer","html_url":"https://github.com/amitanandaiyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2018-01-24T18:06:15Z","updated_at":"2018-02-09T23:25:05Z","closed_at":"2018-02-09T23:25:05Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi folks,\r\n\r\nI was testing how a 3-nodes cluster of YugaByte behaves (from a client perspective) when one of the nodes is isolated from the peers and observed an anomaly: the whole system became unavailable until a connection was restored.\r\n\r\nRepo with Docker+JavaScript scripts to reproduce the problem: https://github.com/rystsov/perseus/tree/master/yugabyte\r\n\r\nTesting environment\r\n\r\n    OS: Ubuntu 17.10\r\n    YugaByte: v0.9.1.0\r\n    NodeJS: v8.9.4\r\n    Redis's \"redis\" driver: \"2.8.0\"\r\n\r\nA client executes three coroutines each of them connects to a corresponding YugaByte's node (`yuga1`, `yuga2` and `yuga3`) and in a loop:\r\n\r\n1. Reads a value from a db\r\n2. Increments it\r\n3. Writes it back\r\n\r\nEach coroutine uses a different key to avoid collisions.\r\n\r\nThe client aggregates a number of successful iterations and dumps it every second:\r\n\r\n<pre>#legend: time|yuga1|yuga2|yuga3|yuga1:err|yuga2:err|yuga3:err\r\n1\t70\t68\t118\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:40\r\n2\t82\t85\t141\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:41</pre>\r\n\r\nThe first column is the number of passed seconds since the beginning of the experiment; the next three columns contain counter of successful iterations of the clients located on each node per last second, following three columns are counters of errors and the last one is time.\r\n\r\nAfter I isolated a `yuga3` node the system became unavailable at least for 366 seconds:\r\n\r\n<pre>#legend: time|yuga1|yuga2|yuga3|yuga1:err|yuga2:err|yuga3:err\r\n1\t70\t68\t118\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:40\r\n2\t82\t85\t141\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:41\r\n...\r\n12\t82\t68\t153\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:51\r\n13\t93\t81\t159\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:52\r\n# isolating yuga3\r\n# isolated yuga3\r\n14\t78\t78\t124\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:53\r\n15\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:27:54\r\n...\r\n380\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:34:00\r\n381\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:34:01\r\n# rejoining yuga3\r\n# rejoined yuga3\r\n382\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:34:02\r\n383\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:34:03\r\n...\r\n432\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:34:52\r\n433\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:34:53\r\n434\t118\t111\t77\t1\t1\t1\t2018/01/24 04:34:54\r\n435\t219\t166\t80\t0\t0\t0\t2018/01/24 04:34:55</pre>\r\n\r\nAfter I reestablished a connection, the system recovered in 51 seconds.\r\n\r\nThe logs: [dead.tar.gz](https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/files/1661058/dead.tar.gz)","closed_by":{"login":"amitanandaiyer","id":32495790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDk1Nzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32495790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer","html_url":"https://github.com/amitanandaiyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}